---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Engineering Lab"
  description="The hands-on engineering environment James Roberts uses to develop and maintain current infrastructure, systems, automation, monitoring, networking and security skills."
>
  <section class="lab-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Engineering Lab</p>
      <h1>Hands-on engineering, kept current.</h1>
      <p class="hero-summary">
        My Engineering Lab is a continuously evolving environment where I develop
        and maintain practical skills across Linux, virtualisation, containers,
        automation, monitoring, networking and security.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/projects">View engineering work</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/skills">Technical skills</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Current Platform</p>
        <h2>A working environment, not a static demonstration.</h2>
        <p>
          The current platform combines Proxmox virtualisation, Linux systems,
          Docker workloads managed through Komodo, central monitoring and logging,
          network services, vulnerability management and network security tooling.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-grid">
        <article><h3>Infrastructure</h3><p>Proxmox VE, Linux, LXC and QEMU/KVM provide the core compute platform, supported by practical networking, DNS, VPN and backup services.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Operations</h3><p>Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Alloy, Alertmanager and Zabbix provide monitoring, logging, alerting and operational visibility across the environment.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Security</h3><p>Greenbone, Suricata and Zeek support vulnerability management and network security monitoring alongside firewalling and controlled remote access.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container purpose-grid">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">How I Use It</p>
        <h2>Practical engineering experience.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>The environment gives me somewhere to design, deploy, troubleshoot and operate complete systems rather than work through isolated tutorials.</p>
        <p>I use it for automation, upgrades, monitoring, incident investigation, backup and recovery testing, security work and evaluating new technologies.</p>
        <p>Changes are documented and increasingly managed through Git and automation so the platform also develops the operational disciplines used in larger environments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container selected-work">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected Engineering Work</p>
        <h2>Explore the technical work in more detail.</h2>
        <p>Individual case studies cover the design decisions, technologies and operational work behind the platform without turning this page into an architecture document.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/projects/engineering-platform">Engineering platform</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects/proxmox-platform">Proxmox platform</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects">All projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lab-hero{padding:7rem 0 5rem}.lab-hero h1{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 1.5rem;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.8rem);letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:.98}.hero-summary{max-width:800px;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.2rem}.summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.25rem}.summary-grid article{padding:1.6rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface)}.summary-grid h3{margin:0 0 .65rem}.summary-grid p,.selected-work p{color:var(--text-muted)}.purpose-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:5rem}.selected-work{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:3rem}.selected-work>div:first-child{max-width:700px}.selected-work h2{margin:0}@media(max-width:900px){.summary-grid,.purpose-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.purpose-grid{gap:2rem}.selected-work{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}@media(max-width:720px){.lab-hero{padding-top:5rem}}
</style>
